├── given contract is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── given invalid inputs
│   ├── when sender is not authorized for onBehalf
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when receiver is zero address
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when position does not exist
│       └── it should revert
└── given valid inputs
