    │   ├── it should transfer tokens to receiver
    │   ├── it should clear position data
    │   ├── it should emit UnlockPosition event
    │   └── it should return released amount
    ├── when position is not expired and not in rescue mode
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when position is expired and in rescue mode
    │   ├── it should transfer tokens to receiver
    │   ├── it should clear position data
